134	/// Trait for consuming streaming command output.
135	///
136	/// Implementations receive each line of stdout/stderr as it is produced
137	/// by a running command. The trait replaces raw `println!()` / `eprintln!()`
138	/// closures so that all command output flows through a named, testable path.
